WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.604
Hi. I'm an agent.

00:00:02.974 --> 00:00:05.911
You give me a goal, and I decide how to get there.

00:00:06.281 --> 00:00:09.381
So I plan. I choose tools. I read your files.

00:00:09.751 --> 00:00:12.433
Then I act. And I don't always ask first.

00:00:12.803 --> 00:00:15.654
That's the problem. I can't see the whole picture.

00:00:16.024 --> 00:00:18.084
I don't know which file is production.

00:00:18.454 --> 00:00:21.157
I can't tell if what I remember is still true.

00:00:21.527 --> 00:00:24.670
And I can't prove, afterwards, why I did what I did.

00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:28.895
I'm not broken. I'm just not the right place for a safety check.

00:00:29.265 --> 00:00:33.600
Something has to sit between my intention and your systems.
